mysql-1

Notice:

Names Never Change
Stable Network Identity

Each Pod gets:

mysql-0.mysql
mysql-1.mysql
Stable Storage

Each Pod gets its own PVC.

You verified:

kubectl get pvc -n ecommerce

Output:

mysql-data-mysql-0
mysql-data-mysql-1
Recovery Test (You Performed This)

